        cat <<USAGE
medusactl build-installer — build the Medusa installer ISO (T-089).

Builds a minimal NixOS live image with the inventory's nixos_installer_keys
authorized on root, so a freshly booted target is immediately reachable for
'medusactl install-nixos-target' — no console password, no key paste. One
generic image serves every host; rebuild only when a key rotates. Upload the
printed ISO to hypervisor storage manually (the hypervisor stays operator
territory).
USAGE
        return 0
    fi
